  "native_sha256": "C49E0965B0841C6E9885289C111BF9F08933A54B271936A3AE16E9398919FD11",
  "note": "1.0.1 compatibility update: exact old/new executable hashes retained; new camera vtable/update/cache/actor getter independently resolved from PE and native registration table; native camera fixtures and settings/UI tests passed. Flight laws and other payload resources unchanged. Updated-game live validation, UE4SS/FOV and missile field baselines remain pending. FPMCI 1.1.0 UI redesign only; native resources unchanged. FPMCI 1.1.2: remove diagnostics page; bound inactive backups/logs; native controller and log producers unchanged. Isolated validation only. FPMCI 1.1.3 integrates supplied AC8PropNav 2.3.9 binary, not a local native rebuild; isolated integration only. FPMCI 1.1.4: instance-only proximity fuse, no shared-table/CDO writes; eleven UI switches; full preset retired. Live detonation/damage untested. FPMCI 1.1.5: independent per-type fuse values and source-backed vanilla references. Current-game live acceptance pending. FPMCI 1.1.6: shared FOV projection, manual-focus flight and continuous camera/FOV release; native isolated and Lua validation only. FPMCI 1.1.7: bounded GUI session-lock wait and refreshed post-wait state; isolated tests only. FPMCI 1.1.8: v2.5.2-derived extra MOD management and optional flight recording. Local candidate integrates optional AC8EnhancedHUD 0.7.3; runtime testing pending. Optional chase-view cockpit HUD; in-game acceptance pending. FPMCI 1.2.0 adds enemy AI settings to the workbench sidebar and integrates third-person EEGS; live visual acceptance pending.",
